<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43924" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sĕrum</span></b> , i, n.
		(collat. form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sĕrū</span></b> , acc. to
			<i><span class="en">Charis. p. 23</span></i> P.) [prob. sibilated
		from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρός</span>]. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>The watery part of curdled milk</i>, <i>whey</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 11, 41, 96, § 239</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">28, 9, 33, §
				126</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Col. 7, 12, 10</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Verg. G. 3,
				406</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Tib. 2, 3, 16</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Ov. F. 4,
				770</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>, like <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀρός</span>, of <i>the watery parts</i>, <i>serum</i>, of other things; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">of resin,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					16, 12, 23, § 60</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">seminis genitalis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cat.
					80, 8</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
